A||||57||Black88GT||Contour SVT race (thanks gt bastard!)||||12||
Z||000000||Black88GT||03-23-2001||08:27 PM||||GT Bastard has gotten me into the racing mood with all of his stories lately (which is a good thing).  Now that the weather is better I have really been itching for a race.  Well I got one...<P>Coming home from work, same road where I raced the Turbo Eclipse, I see some car coming up in the right lane, flying. I look and its a domestic ricer Ford Contour SVT with the rims and the exhaust.  So I was like oh yeah.  I started to give chase.  When he noticed, he tried to pull away.  Ain't gonna happen.  So we got to about 80 before we hit a redlight.  This redlight leads to a bigger road perfect for racing.  Traffic was clogging the 2 middle lanes but the right lane was free so I got behind him.<BR>He nailed it off the line and of course I was right behind him.  He was trying to pull away but I switched lanes and shifted to 3rd.  At this time I handed him his ass on a silver platter.  I flew right by him and shifted to 4th.  When I passed him I could hear his engine SCREAMING.  I was like damn dude shift for crying out loud, your gonna lose anyway hehe.  I didn't know they had 5 speeds but I guess so.  As I reached around 95 I shifted to 5th, by this point we stayed even but I was a good 5 cars ahead of him.  Well its no vtec prelude (hehe) but its my first kill of the year....<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fieropage/af.bmp"> ||||reg||12
Z||000001||88formula||03-23-2001||09:41 PM||||I love these racing stories. Man I want my car on the road soon with its 3.4-liter engine.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||danny boy||03-23-2001||10:05 PM||||Hell yea, that what I'm talkin about.||||reg||1
Z||000003||GT Bastard||03-23-2001||10:33 PM||||hehe... That's sooo cool.  I read a road test on the SVT Contour and it was pretty impressive(for a Contour anyhow.)  Good kill... Carefull when you're weaving through traffic like that, you might just come upon a box of helpless kittens.  Bwahahaha....||||reg||1
