Z||000036||SWTKSTMS||03-26-2001||01:30 PM||||what is up with all the ford lovers in here. i mean i have nothing agaisnt ford but damn these people need to settle down. if you dont like fieros then get the f ck out of this forum. i have watched a fiero take alot of different types of vehicles with no problem. and this one was bone stock. i used to drive a ford mustang, and i raced a fiero and he kept up with no problem, so get off the fiero bashing. it kind of reminds me of how those ricers act. ||||reg||1
Z||000037||Raydar||03-26-2001||03:22 PM||||If Ford hadn't dropped the SVT Contour, I would probably own one by now. I have a friend who asked me to do some work on his Contour, and I was really impressed with how it was designed and put together. <BR>I refuse to be a part of the <BR>"Ford sucks!" <BR>"No. GM sucks!" <BR>"No. Honda sucks!" argument.<BR>Most folks preferences are based upon what they know how to work on.<BR>And, I might add, <I>anything</I> can be modded to the point of absolute uselessness with the careful application of enough bad taste and money.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Later<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 03-26-2001).]||||reg||1
