Z||000057||Trapps||03-28-2001||10:35 AM||||Glad we can all "just get along." And thanks for comments. The Supertrapp mufflers are not for everyone, and are usually found on big block V8s from GM and Ford. The caps in the pic above are stainless steel. I use them in wniter here in Michigan. In the summer I run these.   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1204400&a=8883688&p=29147581&Sequence=0">  <BR>For those interested, I run 16 discs per side.<P>Mark<p>[This message has been edited by Trapps (edited 03-28-2001).]||||reg||1
